# When Angels Fall (CoP 8-3): each race's own panel at Status 2 (GMs). Main (Hume, race 2) at Ebon_Panel_Galka:
# NO_NEED_INVESTIGATE (7644, the zone's default); at _iz2 (races 1 and 2): 120, finished 1: Light of Vahzl (593),
# the title, Status 3. bob (race 4) at Ebon_Panel_Elvaan: 121, Light of Mea (592); cat (race 6) at Ebon_Panel_Taru:
# 123, Light of Holla (590); dan (race 7) at Ebon_Panel_Mithra: 124, Light of Dem (591); eve (Galka, 8) at
# Ebon_Panel_Galka: 122, Light of Al'Taieu (594). Each finish gives the title and Status 3.
lists TheGardenOfRuhmet/_iz2/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/Ebon_Panel_Elvaan/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/Ebon_Panel_Taru/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/Ebon_Panel_Mithra/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/Ebon_Panel_Galka/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/120 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/121 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/122 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/123 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/124
char zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=2
char bob zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=4
char cat zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=6
char dan zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=7
char eve zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0 race=8
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
charvar Mission[6][828]Status 2
bob: mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
bob: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 2
cat: mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
cat: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 2
dan: mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
dan: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 2
eve: mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
eve: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 2
login
trigger Ebon_Panel_Galka
finish-if-event
trigger _iz2
finish option=1
bob: login
bob: trigger Ebon_Panel_Elvaan
bob: finish option=1
cat: login
cat: trigger Ebon_Panel_Taru
cat: finish option=1
dan: login
dan: trigger Ebon_Panel_Mithra
dan: finish option=1
eve: login
eve: trigger Ebon_Panel_Galka
eve: finish option=1
